      "content": "I hear what you're saying about official reports, but it feels like you're just dismissing anyone who has actual concerns as being part of a 'political group.' If there are specific vulnerabilities that experts have pointed out—like chain of custody issues or signature verification problems—why skip over those? It feels like you're just telling me everything is fine because the government says so.",
